### ============ PERFORMANCE COMPARISON TESTS ============

### Test 1: Get all students (no filter) - IQueryable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?method=iqueryable
Accept: application/json


### Test 2: Get all students (no filter) - IEnumerable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?method=ienumerable
Accept: application/json


### Test 3: Filter by MinAge=25 - IQueryable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?minAge=25&method=iqueryable
Accept: application/json


### Test 4: Filter by MinAge=25 - IEnumerable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?minAge=25&method=ienumerable
Accept: application/json


### Test 5: Filter by MaxAge=25 - IQueryable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?maxAge=25&method=iqueryable
Accept: application/json


### Test 6: Filter by MaxAge=25 - IEnumerable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?maxAge=25&method=ienumerable
Accept: application/json


### Test 7: Filter by Address containing "St" - IQueryable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?address=St&method=iqueryable
Accept: application/json


### Test 8: Filter by Address containing "St" - IEnumerable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?address=St&method=ienumerable
Accept: application/json


### Test 9: Combined filters - Age 20-30 and Address "Main" - IQueryable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?minAge=20&maxAge=30&address=Main&method=iqueryable
Accept: application/json


### Test 10: Combined filters - Age 20-30 and Address "Main" - IEnumerable
GET {{sem2week1_HostAddress}}/api/Student/filtered?minAge=20&maxAge=30&address=Main&method=ienumerable
Accept: application/json
